ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e传说任务：\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"4707\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/09/05/5700838/a44b68fa4c54e443e23e1d82d563f16d_992681583740297159.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"鲸天之章 第一幕「独眼小宝总动员」\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4707/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4707/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e鲸天之章 第一幕「独眼小宝总动员」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e角色邀约：\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"6268\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/8a04d5fdb7047c2fbcad80d4fb35208a_8221290323537003821.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"邀约事件·凝光 第一幕「玉阁归客至」\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6268/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6268/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e邀约事件·凝光 第一幕「玉阁归客至」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3882","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"option\":\"【这里是？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这里是璃月港内贷款利率、存款利率都最能让客户满意的银行…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e当然，如果借贷的话，请记得一定要按时还款…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e千万不要以为我们这里只是一家普通的银行，欠债不还的情况…我们是决定不会让它发生的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呵，您见过浮冰吗？人的眼睛能看到的只是水面上的那部分，而水面之下隐藏着的部分…谁都不知道有多大。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e希望您可以在了解这些情况的前提下，再来办理相关业务，这样对您更有好处，呵呵。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e欢迎来到北国银行，有什么可以帮您的吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8p7p0je9jjsT1720120852023\":{\"option\":\"【再见。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e再见，祝您一切顺利，呵呵…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"m8ws3zmssuT1720120823120\":{\"option\":\"【你们和愚人众…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…您是想问我们和愚人众的关系吧？不好意思，这是内部机密，无可奉告。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我可以告诉您的是，愚人众的执行官确实是我们的大客户。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e例如那位「公子」大人在我们这里的存款数额，光是数字后面的零就已经让人看得眼花缭乱了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过对执行官这个级别的大人物来说，钱也只是单纯的数字罢了，只要他想要，恐怕没有什么是得不到的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"option\":\"【想要兑换…】——打开商店界面\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哦？钱袋上的元素力…没错，是我们「北国银行」的凭证。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e想要把面值过于庞大的金币，全都兑换成零钱，是吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如你所愿，客人。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(140, 140, 140)\\\"\u003e（该对话将在摩拉袋全部兑换完毕后消失）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/07/05/183046623/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_4110797304174018158.png\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"option\":\"【你是？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我？我是北国银行的接待员，如果是想要办理业务，那我可以帮您引荐我们的经理。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[\"m8ws3zmssuT1720120823120\"],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"8p7p0je9jjsT1720120852023\"],\"8p7p0je9jjsT1720120852023\":[],\"m8ws3zmssuT1720120823120\":[],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1720167217","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1210","pos":"banner"},{"id":"3885","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"694","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1211","pos":"left"},{"id":"1212","pos":"right"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","menus":[{"id":"20","name":"NPC\u0026商店","has_page":false,"style":"","sub_menus":[],"icon":"","mi18n_key"